v0.2.0: camera-following UI, tab-target system, AI locks, victory laps

- Arena 2796x1290 (torus), 640x360 camera follows the player ship with
  velocity lead; auto-director when spectating
- All combat geometry rescaled x2.4 (planet, speeds, ranges); 2x sprites
- Tab-target system: TAB cycles hostiles, auto-acquire on possess;
  target panel upper right (hull/batt/range/closing); lock brackets +
  off-screen edge arrows
- Player panel upper left with subtle amber LOCKED warning when AI
  targeting computers hold a lock on the player
- AI targeting now sticky (hysteresis) so duels persist
- E releases the helm (Tab repurposed for targeting)
- Victory: no screenshake/flash, ordnance defused, winners fly AI
  victory laps around the planet under the scoreboard
